---
import { Container } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <Container>
    <section class="page-shell">
      <div class="title-block">
        <p class="eyebrow">AI Agent Development Services</p>
        <h1>AI Agent Development Services</h1>
      </div>

      <p class="lead">
        At <strong>Linkly LLC</strong>, we build intelligent, autonomous AI agents
        and workflow automation systems designed to streamline operations,
        enhance decision-making, and boost organizational productivity. By
        combining state-of-the-art Large Language Models (LLMs) with custom
        backend integration, we turn cutting-edge artificial intelligence into
        actionable business tools.
      </p>

      <div class="section-block">
        <h2>What We Build</h2>
        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>1. Autonomous Workflow &amp; Task Agents</h3>
            <p>
              AI systems designed to execute multi-step business processes
              independently. From processing documents and triaging customer
              support tickets to managing internal workflows, our agents reduce
              manual effort and eliminate operational bottlenecks.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>2. Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) &amp; Knowledge Assistants</h3>
            <p>
              Custom enterprise AI assistants trained on your internal
              documentation, knowledge bases, and databases. We allow teams and
              customers to instantly query proprietary data with pinpoint accuracy,
              strict context controls, and zero data leakage.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>3. Multi-Agent Orchestration Systems</h3>
            <p>
              Complex AI environments where specialized autonomous agents
              collaborate—passing data, executing tools, and verifying outputs—to
              handle intricate business tasks like research, automated coding, lead
              scoring, and financial analysis.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>4. Custom AI Integration &amp; Model Fine-Tuning</h3>
            <p>
              Seamlessly integrate modern AI capabilities into your existing
              software ecosystem. We connect foundation models directly to your
              APIs, CRMs, ERPs, and databases, customizing model behavior to match
              your exact domain needs.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-block">
        <h2>Core Technologies</h2>
        <div class="tech-grid">
          <article class="tech-card">
            <h3>OpenAI</h3>
            <p>
              Foundation Models — Powered by GPT-4o and advanced reasoning models
              for high-level comprehension, structured output generation, and task
              execution.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="tech-card">
            <h3>LangChain</h3>
            <p>
              Agentic Framework — Context management, agent chaining, tool-use
              integration, vector database connectors, and complex prompt pipelines.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="tech-card">
            <h3>Custom AI</h3>
            <p>
              Proprietary Logic — Tailored vector embeddings, custom model
              fine-tuning, open-source LLM hosting (Llama, Mistral), and
              specialized safety guardrails.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-block">
        <h2>How We Deliver: Our AI Implementation Process</h2>
        <ol class="process-list">
          <li>
            <strong>AI Readiness &amp; Use-Case Mapping</strong>
            <p>
              We evaluate your workflows and data infrastructure to pinpoint
              high-ROI opportunities for automation and autonomous agent
              integration.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>System Architecture &amp; Guardrail Design</strong>
            <p>
              We establish clear system prompts, vector retrieval mechanisms,
              tool access permissions, and strict safety guardrails to ensure
              output accuracy and compliance.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Agent Engineering &amp; Integration</strong>
            <p>
              Our engineers build and train the agents using LangChain and modern
              vector databases, integrating them directly with your web or mobile
              applications.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Evaluation, Red-Teaming &amp; Testing</strong>
            <p>
              We rigorously test AI performance against edge cases, benchmarking
              output quality, latency, token usage costs, and response
              reliability.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Deployment &amp; Continuous Monitoring</strong>
            <p>
              We deploy agents into production environments with active telemetry,
              cost-tracking controls, and feedback loops for continuous model
              optimization.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-shell {
    margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
    max-width: 1100px;
  }

  .title-block {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--theme-accent);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-block {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .service-grid,
  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-card,
  .tech-card {
    background: var(--theme-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
    padding: 28px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .service-card h3,
  .tech-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem);
  }

  .service-card p,
  .tech-card p,
  .process-list p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .process-list {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
  }

  .process-list li + li {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .service-grid,
    .tech-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
